Deployment Workflow
Setup Secrets (Generates kubernetes/backend-k8s/database-secret.yaml):
bash
./setup_secrets.sh
Deploy Backend (Applies everything in backend directory, including the generated secret):
bash
kubectl apply -f kubernetes/backend-k8s
Deploy Frontend (Applies everything in frontend directory):
bash
kubectl apply -f kubernetes/frontend-k8s
